            <div xml:id="d82">

                <pb facs="0195" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg165"/>

                <head>82. Dispatch From the CIA Chief of Station in
                    Guatemala (Givloch) to the Chief of the Western
                    Hemisphere Division, Central Intelligence Agency (King)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d82-f1"/></head>
                <dateline><placeName>Guatemala City</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1954-01-11">January 11, 1954</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">HGG-A-634</p>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>General—PBSUCCESS</item>
                    <item>Specific—Stephen R. Lugton</item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>In accordance with instructions received from Lugton, material received
                        from him for forwarding is being placed in envelopes marked “To
                            Lincoln, for Jerome C.
                            Dunbar only” and included in Station Guatemala pouches for
                        Washington. As per his request, only one copy of such material has been made
                        and therefore station files will contain no record of information submitted
                        by him. This station will therefore not be held responsible for being
                        knowledgeable of information submitted by him.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>It is assumed that the policy of handling his material and the principle
                        expressed is in accord with the wishes of Lincoln and
                        Headquarters. If not, this station would appreciate being advised.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Kenneth S.
                        Givloch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d82-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d82-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Job 79-01025A, Box 98, Folder 7. Secret;
                    Rybat. Sent for information to Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in Florida
                    (Lincoln).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
